# NSpark integration-test secrets.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` at the repository root and fill in
# real BIP-39 mnemonics for funded test wallets. The integration tests
# under tests/NSpark.IntegrationTests/ will refuse to run (Assert.Inconclusive)
# unless the variables below resolve to a non-empty value.
#
# `.env.local` is git-ignored — never commit a real mnemonic.
#
# Values can also be supplied directly as process environment variables; the
# environment always wins over this file.
#
# Format: KEY=VALUE per line. # starts a comment. Optional `export ` prefix
# is stripped. Matching single or double quotes around the value are removed.
# No variable expansion or escape processing — keep values single-line.

# Primary test wallet. Should hold a small balance for invoice / pay flows.
NSPARK_TEST_MNEMONIC_A=

# Counterparty wallet for transfer / pay tests. Also funded.
NSPARK_TEST_MNEMONIC_B=

# Third-party wallet for multi-wallet flows. Funded only if you need
# those tests to pass.
NSPARK_TEST_MNEMONIC_C=
